0001/** New Program REDIF.
0002/**
0003/** :author tzu
0004/* USING THE REDIFINE STATEMENT FOR A GROUP
0005* DEFINE DATA LOCAL
0006* 1 #NEW-EMPLOYEE (A80) INIT <'INNOCENT 2100535526 PRETORIA'>
0007* 1 REDEFINE #NEW-EMPLOYEE
0008* 2 #EMPLOYEE-NAME (A9)
0009* 2 #EMPLOYEE-ID (N8)
0010* 2 #EMPLOYEE-AGE (N2)
0011* 2 #EMPLOYEE-ADDRESS (A9)
0012* END-DEFINE
0013* 
0014* WRITE 
0015* 'NAME   '#EMPLOYEE-NAME / 
0016* 'EMP-ID '#EMPLOYEE-ID / 
0017* 'EMP-AGE'#EMPLOYEE-AGE /
0018* 'ADDRESS'#EMPLOYEE-ADDRESS
0019* END
0020
0021DEFINE DATA LOCAL
00221 INCOME
0023  2 MONTH (12)
0024  3 SALARY (N5)
0025* 1 REDEFINE SALARY
0026* 2 SALARY(N5/1:12)
0027
0028END-DEFINE
0029
0030END
